{
  "slug": "green-bay-marathon",
  "title": "Run50 #第20州｜威斯康辛：绿湾马拉松｜跑进兰博球场的最后一届",
  "page": "/run50/wechat/green-bay-marathon-modern-rail.html",
  "status": "pending",
  "entry_fix": false,
  "intro": "从风城和密歇根湖一路北上，在奶酪州的 热浪 里跑进 Green Bay Packers 的圣地兰博球场。",
  "map": "/assets/cn-article-maps/us-light-52b684ccaf1dbdcb.png",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-zh-green-bay-marathon.jpg?v=20260703-wi-green-bay",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "跨过风城，奔向奶酪州"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>实习才一周，Run<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">50 </span>已经催着上路。<span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">520 </span>这天，我和 Siqi 决定北上，直奔威斯康辛——去跑第<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">20</span>个州：绿湾马拉松（Cellcom Green Bay Marathon）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>周五傍晚出发，夕阳把农田和粮仓染成金黄，车子像穿行在一幅油画里。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "夕阳下的农田与粮仓 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "夕阳下的农田与粮仓 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>第二天一早，在 Lafayette 简单吃了份“美式标配”早餐后，继续上路。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "出发前的炒蛋和玛芬 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "出发前的炒蛋和玛芬 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>继续北上，蓝天下是乡间公路和成片风车，路上还能看到车尾挂着自行车的旅人。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "蓝天下的乡间公路 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "蓝天下的乡间公路 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "高速旁的风力发电机 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "高速旁的风力发电机 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "车尾挂着自行车的旅人 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "车尾挂着自行车的旅人 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>驶近芝加哥摩天大楼的天际线，红色导航提示让我们在风城高速里“龟速漂移”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "驶近芝加哥天际线 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "驶近芝加哥天际线 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "导航里的芝加哥拥堵路段 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "导航里的芝加哥拥堵路段 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>好在穿出来时，已是开阔的北境蓝天。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>进入威斯康辛，第一站是 密尔沃基：NBA 雄鹿队的主场。当年易建联就是 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">2007 </span>年首轮 <span>6 </span>号秀被选中加盟雄鹿。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>听说他刚开始还有点不咋不乐意来，觉得这里是北境苦寒之地。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>不过后来阿联还是在这里打出了几个赛季的高光，现在密尔沃基的招牌已经是字母哥。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>刚一进城，我们就意外地觉得密尔沃基也不算小啊，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "驶入密尔沃基市区 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "驶入密尔沃基市区 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "高架旁的密尔沃基河景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "高架旁的密尔沃基河景 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然后我们在市区吃了一顿很不错的印度自助。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "印度自助餐台上的米饭与咖喱 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "印度自助餐台上的米饭与咖喱 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "午餐桌前的 Siqi @Arsenan",
      "alt": "午餐桌前的 Siqi @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最后用芒果冰淇淋收尾，出门再留个影。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "一勺芒果冰淇淋 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "一勺芒果冰淇淋 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "印度餐厅门前留影 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "印度餐厅门前留影 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>饭后去密歇根湖畔吹个风，散个步。湖蓝与天蓝交融，让人感觉已经跨进了“北境”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "湖畔草坪与城市楼群 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "湖畔草坪与城市楼群 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "密歇根湖边的步道 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "密歇根湖边的步道 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "堤岸外的蓝色湖面 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "堤岸外的蓝色湖面 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>继续开车，终于抵达终点：绿湾（Green Bay）· 威斯康辛 （Wisconsin）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "奶酪州的橄榄球信仰"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>威斯康辛（Wisconsin），外号 “奶酪州”。一出门就是成片牧场和乳制品厂，奶酪产量全美第一。这里的球迷还自创了著名的 Cheesehead 奶酪头帽子，成了威州人的标志性符号。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "护栏旁的奶酪帽观众 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "护栏旁的奶酪帽观众 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>而绿湾（Green Bay），则是 NFL 最小的主场城市——Green Bay Packers 的大本营：</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>- Packers 是 NFL 唯一由球迷持股的球队，主场 Lambeau Field（兰博球场） 被视为橄榄球圣地；</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>- 球队历史上拿过 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">13 </span>次<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">冠军</strong>，在超级碗创立之前就已经横扫天下；</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>- 在这座只有 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">10 </span>万人口的小城里，球迷人数比居民还多，赛季期间整座城市就像是活在橄榄球里。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>所以，绿湾马拉松最大的噱头就是：冲过终点前，会绕进兰博球场。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>对跑者来说，这不仅是一场马拉松，更像是用双脚跑进了美国体育文化的心脏。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "抵达绿湾 · 小镇氛围"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>到 Green Bay 的第一件事，就是去 Expo 领参赛包。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "Expo 号码布领取处 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Expo 号码布领取处 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>工作人员们穿着统一的荧光绿T恤，一个老爷爷看到我穿着“安克雷奇马拉松”的衣服，还好奇问我是不是来自阿拉斯加。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "递来参赛服的志愿者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "递来参赛服的志愿者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我笑着说只是去跑过那场马拉松，并顺手又抖了一次老梗，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>说Siqi当时在安克雷奇赛道上真的看见过熊横穿马路，吓得她赶紧拿出手机拍照。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "领物现场的双人合影 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "领物现场的双人合影 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "Siqi 在领物台前 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Siqi 在领物台前 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>领完号码布，我们去超市补给了一车零食和水果。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "装满零食和饮料的购物车 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "装满零食和饮料的购物车 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然后顺道在市中心的 Leicht Memorial Park（莱希特纪念公园）溜达。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "莱希特纪念公园入口 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "莱希特纪念公园入口 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这里靠着福克斯河，河边插满各国国旗。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "福克斯河对岸的楼房 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "福克斯河对岸的楼房 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "河畔步道旁的旗杆 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "河畔步道旁的旗杆 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "福克斯河上的桥 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "福克斯河上的桥 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>公园里还立着总统 Zachary Taylor 的雕像。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "公园里的扎卡里·泰勒雕像 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "公园里的扎卡里·泰勒雕像 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>听说，每隔三四年，这里会举办一次 Tall Ship Festival（大帆船节），世界各地的古典大帆船会驶进绿湾港。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>傍晚又在水边走了走，石堤上停着一群水鸟，沙滩和湖湾安静下来。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "停在石堤上的一群水鸟 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "停在石堤上的一群水鸟 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-033.webp",
      "caption": "傍晚的沙滩与湖湾 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "傍晚的沙滩与湖湾 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-034.webp",
      "caption": "沙滩边散步留影 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "沙滩边散步留影 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>暮色里，继续开车去 Airbnb。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-036.webp",
      "caption": "暮色中的高速公路 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "暮色中的高速公路 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>房东是一对老夫妻，屋里既温馨又充满 Packers 的元素。客厅通向露台和后院。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-037.webp",
      "caption": "通向露台的民宿客厅 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "通向露台的民宿客厅 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>墙上挂着画，正中是 Lambeau Field。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-038.webp",
      "caption": "以兰博球场为中心的绿湾挂画 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "以兰博球场为中心的绿湾挂画 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>门口的小乌龟摆件戴着墨镜和项链，憨态可掬。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-039.webp",
      "caption": "门口戴墨镜的小乌龟摆件 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "门口戴墨镜的小乌龟摆件 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>玄关木牌上画着绿色头盔，还写着“John ♥ Terri”，随处可见绿黄配色的小细节。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-035.webp",
      "caption": "房东门口的 Packers 欢迎牌 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "房东门口的 Packers 欢迎牌 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>老奶奶说橄榄球赛季这里很热闹，她家都会住满。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>果然，在绿湾，橄榄球就是一种生活方式。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "比赛日清晨 · 热浪出击"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>第二天一早，阳光已经很强，天气预示着会是个“<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">热浪</strong>加持”的比赛日。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "caption": "比赛日出门前整理头带 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "比赛日出门前整理头带 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我的战袍是一件经典款 阿森纳球衣，是我妈刚从国内寄来的，背后是科奎林的号码。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-041.webp",
      "caption": "晨光下穿好球衣出发 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "晨光下穿好球衣出发 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>一个曾经凶猛的枪手兽腰，和我年轻时候风格很像。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>今年的 Cellcom Green Bay Marathon 听说是最后一届，恰逢 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">25 </span>周年，带点告别的意味。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛道起点设在 Lambeau Field 附近，热闹的氛围让人兴奋。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-042.webp",
      "caption": "赛前在起点区域合影 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "赛前在起点区域合影 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-043.webp",
      "caption": "等待出发的跑者们 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "等待出发的跑者们 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-044.webp",
      "caption": "穿过 START 起跑拱门 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "穿过 START 起跑拱门 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>路线一开始大多在小区里穿行，绿树成荫，但景色相对单调。跑过第 1、第 2 英里，路边就是社区补给站。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-045.webp",
      "caption": "第1英里路牌旁的跑者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "第1英里路牌旁的跑者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-046.webp",
      "caption": "跑过社区里的第2英里 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "跑过社区里的第2英里 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-047.webp",
      "caption": "住宅区路边的补给站 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "住宅区路边的补给站 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>第 3、第 4 英里，继续顺着社区道路向前。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-048.webp",
      "caption": "开阔道路上的第3英里 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "开阔道路上的第3英里 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-049.webp",
      "caption": "树荫边的第4英里路牌 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "树荫边的第4英里路牌 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>唯一变化多的，是影子的方向：一会儿在前，一会儿在后，有时又偏到左边或右边。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-050.webp",
      "caption": "朝着第5英里继续跑 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "朝着第5英里继续跑 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-051.webp",
      "caption": "绿树下的第6英里 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "绿树下的第6英里 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>穿着阿森纳球衣跑在社区里，也给自己留几张赛道上的照片。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-052.webp",
      "caption": "穿阿森纳球衣的赛道自拍 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "穿阿森纳球衣的赛道自拍 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-055.webp",
      "caption": "官方镜头里的社区赛道 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "官方镜头里的社区赛道 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-103.webp",
      "caption": "社区赛道上的张臂瞬间 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "社区赛道上的张臂瞬间 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>穿过一条条住宅街道，第 9 英里也到了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-053.webp",
      "caption": "沿社区街道前行的跑者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "沿社区街道前行的跑者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-054.webp",
      "caption": "经过第9英里路牌 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "经过第9英里路牌 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑过 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">10 英里</span>时，感觉新鞋出了点问题。这次穿的是飞影 PB <span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">5.0 </span>黑色款，没有我最爱的 飞影 Plaid 澎湃，也没那么合脚，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">10 英里</span>就有点磨脚了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-056.webp",
      "caption": "来到第10英里 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "来到第10英里 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>再次验证了马拉松铁律：新鞋上马，风险自担。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "湖畔赛道 · 冰雪州的热考验"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>小区尾段，路边好多小孩，胖的、瘦的、穿着小裙子的，都把手伸出来和跑者击掌。阳光打在他们身上，脸蛋晒得红扑扑的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-057.webp",
      "caption": "跑者与路边孩子击掌 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "跑者与路边孩子击掌 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-058.webp",
      "caption": "孩子们伸手等着击掌 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "孩子们伸手等着击掌 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>接着迎来跨过 Fox River（福克斯河） 的铁桥，它属于升降式大铁桥，可以掀开让大船驶入港口。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-059.webp",
      "caption": "迎着阳光跑上铁桥 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "迎着阳光跑上铁桥 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>绿湾港口曾经是造纸和木材的集散地，现在航运依旧繁忙，铁矿石、煤炭和粮食是主要货物。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑过桥面时，铁格子咯吱作响，阳光从缝隙间漏下来，脚下是湛蓝的河水，有点晃眼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-060.webp",
      "caption": "跑过钢格栅桥面 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "跑过钢格栅桥面 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>类似的大铁桥，我在芝加哥和迈阿密也跑过。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>过桥后继续向前，来到树荫下的第 12 英里。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-061.webp",
      "caption": "树荫下的第12英里 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "树荫下的第12英里 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛道边有接力区，热情的志愿者递水递能量胶，但此时气温已逐渐升高。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-062.webp",
      "caption": "路旁志愿者与经过的跑者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "路旁志愿者与经过的跑者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>再往前，是高架桥前的第 15 英里路牌。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-063.webp",
      "caption": "高架桥前的第15英里 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "高架桥前的第15英里 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跨过大桥就是城郊，房子少了，取而代之的是大片空旷的绿地和<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">湿地</strong>，风吹过， 芦苇荡 起伏如波浪。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-064.webp",
      "caption": "赛道旁的一片芦苇 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "赛道旁的一片芦苇 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>路上还会经过几段住宅区，街角的居民热情挥手。第 16 英里，继续向绿道靠近。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-065.webp",
      "caption": "蓝天下的住宅区长路 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "蓝天下的住宅区长路 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-066.webp",
      "caption": "在街角挥手的居民 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "在街角挥手的居民 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-067.webp",
      "caption": "第16英里路牌旁继续前进 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "第16英里路牌旁继续前进 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>很快进入到 Fox River Trail（福克斯河绿道），这是全马跑者的专属路段。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-068.webp",
      "caption": "绿道边排成一列的志愿者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "绿道边排成一列的志愿者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-069.webp",
      "caption": "沿河绿道上的骑行者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "沿河绿道上的骑行者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>沿着河边跑，举起双臂，也和身后的大桥合个影。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-070.webp",
      "caption": "河畔张开双臂的瞬间 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "河畔张开双臂的瞬间 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-071.webp",
      "caption": "以河上大桥为背景自拍 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "以河上大桥为背景自拍 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-072.webp",
      "caption": "桥墩倒映在福克斯河上 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桥墩倒映在福克斯河上 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>绿树掩映，视线尽头是一条笔直的幽径。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-073.webp",
      "caption": "树冠连成拱廊的绿道 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "树冠连成拱廊的绿道 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑到第 19 英里，路边有一处写着 PEACE 的花坛。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-074.webp",
      "caption": "第19英里路牌前留影 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "第19英里路牌前留影 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-075.webp",
      "caption": "河边的 PEACE 花坛 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "河边的 PEACE 花坛 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>偶尔有居民在门口支小椅子加油，更多时候只有大鹅成群结队在草地上嘎嘎乱叫。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-076.webp",
      "caption": "坐在路边为跑者加油的观众 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "坐在路边为跑者加油的观众 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-077.webp",
      "caption": "沿着福克斯河继续向前 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "沿着福克斯河继续向前 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-078.webp",
      "caption": "草坪上的大鹅一家 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "草坪上的大鹅一家 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>离开绿道，又回到街区和桥边。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-079.webp",
      "caption": "穿过街区的几位跑者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "穿过街区的几位跑者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-080.webp",
      "caption": "从桥上望向福克斯河 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "从桥上望向福克斯河 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>等我离开绿道、再次回到铁桥时，桥上正开过一辆绿色的清扫车，巨大的轮胎碾在铁板上，发出“哐哐”的声响，对面就是 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">22 英里</span>的路牌。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-081.webp",
      "caption": "经过桥面的绿色卡车 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "经过桥面的绿色卡车 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-082.webp",
      "caption": "跑向第22英里 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "跑向第22英里 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>再吃一包能量胶，撑过后面几英里。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-083.webp",
      "caption": "手里的能量胶补给 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "手里的能量胶补给 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "NFL圣地 · 兰博冲线"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最后几英里，我已经是跑跑走走的节奏，偶尔能看到急救志愿者骑着自行车在赛道巡逻。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-084.webp",
      "caption": "赛道上的两位骑行人员 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "赛道上的两位骑行人员 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>顶着烈日来到 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">25 英里</span>牌，远远就能望见那片绿色巨墙：Lambeau Field（兰博球场）！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-085.webp",
      "caption": "兰博球场已经在眼前 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "兰博球场已经在眼前 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-086.webp",
      "caption": "第25英里路牌与计时钟 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "第25英里路牌与计时钟 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然而“冰雪州”的名号并不能掩盖今天的<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">热浪</strong>。头顶太阳像火球一样悬挂。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-087.webp",
      "caption": "电线之间的烈日 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "电线之间的烈日 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>球场外还有补给摊位，往入口走，还遇到一位穿着消防装备的参赛者。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-088.webp",
      "caption": "球场外的补给摊位 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "球场外的补给摊位 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-089.webp",
      "caption": "穿消防装备前行的参赛者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "穿消防装备前行的参赛者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这座球场是 Green Bay Packers 的圣地，球迷心中的“美国橄榄球圣殿”。容量不算最大，却是最具传奇色彩的之一。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这已经是我第三次跑进橄榄球场：之前在 丹佛马拉松、Marshall University 马拉松也有过类似经历。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑进球场内沿，观众席上小朋友伸出双手，和跑者击掌。那一瞬间，真的像是自己也成了 NFL 球员。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-090.webp",
      "caption": "看台边等着击掌的孩子们 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "看台边等着击掌的孩子们 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-091.webp",
      "caption": "沿兰博球场内沿奔跑 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "沿兰博球场内沿奔跑 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-092.webp",
      "caption": "贴着球场草坪绕行 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "贴着球场草坪绕行 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>那会儿，我想如果不踢足球，我打橄榄球应该也挺厉害，我不仅能跑，还胖！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-093.webp",
      "caption": "在兰博球场张臂奔跑 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "在兰博球场张臂奔跑 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-094.webp",
      "caption": "绿黄看台前的笑容 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "绿黄看台前的笑容 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-095.webp",
      "caption": "沿球场边道继续向前 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "沿球场边道继续向前 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>沿着球场内沿绕过去，再从通道跑出去。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-096.webp",
      "caption": "回望球场内沿与看台 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "回望球场内沿与看台 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-097.webp",
      "caption": "穿过球场通道时自拍 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "穿过球场通道时自拍 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>冲出球场时，路边一群孩子看到我穿着 阿森纳球衣，激动地喊：“曼城是<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">冠军</strong>！”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-100.webp",
      "caption": "路口锥桶旁的加油观众 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "路口锥桶旁的加油观众 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑步这会儿正好碰上英超最后一轮，阿森纳又一次差了一口气。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最后一英里，迎着毒辣的阳光奔向终点，又收割了一堆摄影师的快门声。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-098.webp",
      "caption": "举着相机奔向终点 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "举着相机奔向终点 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-099.webp",
      "caption": "终点前举起双臂 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "终点前举起双臂 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "穿阿森纳球衣张臂奔跑 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "穿阿森纳球衣张臂奔跑 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>摄影师镜头里，仍然是举着双臂的笑脸。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-101.webp",
      "caption": "阳光下张臂奔向终点 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "阳光下张臂奔向终点 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-102.webp",
      "caption": "终点前的笑脸特写 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "终点前的笑脸特写 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-104.webp",
      "caption": "终点护栏前继续奔跑 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "终点护栏前继续奔跑 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>眼前终于是 FINISH 拱门，冲线！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-105.webp",
      "caption": "眼前的 FINISH 终点拱门 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "眼前的 FINISH 终点拱门 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-106.webp",
      "caption": "穿过终点拱门 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "穿过终点拱门 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-107.webp",
      "caption": "终点计时钟旁的自拍 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "终点计时钟旁的自拍 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>冲线后，志愿者迎面走来。Siqi 比我早一步完赛，在这样的高温下还能跑出不错的成绩，挺厉害。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-108.webp",
      "caption": "冲线后迎面走来的志愿者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "冲线后迎面走来的志愿者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-109.webp",
      "caption": "终点区等候的 Siqi @Arsenan",
      "alt": "终点区等候的 Siqi @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>一起到帐篷下歇一歇，再去路边拉伸一下。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-110.webp",
      "caption": "戴着奖牌在帐篷下合影 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "戴着奖牌在帐篷下合影 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-111.webp",
      "caption": "完赛后在路边拉伸 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "完赛后在路边拉伸 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我带着不合脚的新鞋，在 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">4小时</span>半左右完成了全程，拿到了一枚有 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">25</span>周年纪念印记 的奖牌。第 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">20 </span>个州，威斯康辛，再下一城。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-112.webp",
      "caption": "绿湾马拉松25周年奖牌 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "绿湾马拉松25周年奖牌 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>戴上奖牌，在完赛背板前好好留个纪念。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-113.webp",
      "caption": "完赛背板前的双人合影 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "完赛背板前的双人合影 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-114.webp",
      "caption": "背板前举起双臂庆祝 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "背板前举起双臂庆祝 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-115.webp",
      "caption": "展示胸前的完赛奖牌 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "展示胸前的完赛奖牌 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>离开赛场前，再和 Siqi 合影一张。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-116.webp",
      "caption": "离开赛场前的奖牌合影 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "离开赛场前的奖牌合影 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "一个里程碑"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>坐回车里，准备返程。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-119.webp",
      "caption": "回到车里，准备返程 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "回到车里，准备返程 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>返程的路，再次穿过芝加哥时，我们在高速出口随意找了一家“貌似很正宗”的“美式”中餐馆。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-117.webp",
      "caption": "返程中餐馆里的一桌饭菜 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "返程中餐馆里的一桌饭菜 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>味道非常普通，非常模板化，只能算是旅途中的一个补给点吧。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-118.webp",
      "caption": "赛后补给的一碗汤面 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "赛后补给的一碗汤面 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我和 Siqi 轮流驾驶，直到凌晨 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">12</span>:<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">30 </span>才回到家。冲个澡，倒头就睡。第二天依旧要照常上班：实习刚开始，兄弟我还得加把劲。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-121.webp",
      "caption": "深夜手表上的时间 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "深夜手表上的时间 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>回看这场 Cellcom Green Bay Marathon：</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>它是赛事的 最后一届，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">25 </span>年画上句点，我点儿还挺好，赶上了，在这还完成了我 Run<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">50 </span>的第二十州。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">20</span>/<span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">50</span>，五分之二，有点厉害，总算是有零有整了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Green-Bay-Marathon-clean_files/img-120.webp",
      "caption": "手表记录的路线与跑步数据 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "手表记录的路线与跑步数据 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>威斯康辛，这个北境的“冰雪州”，偏偏用一场炽热的高温迎接跑者们，有点上强度了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>不过，兰博球场的冲线，福克斯河畔吹过的风，晒得发亮的小孩，都留下了清晰的画面。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我在想：跑步，应该不只是里程和州数的累积，也是土地和人的相遇。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这让我想起最近看的电视剧 《万物生》：土地和人，是有感情的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>它能长出庄稼，也能留住脚印，照片和视频。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>对我来说，每一次越州，就是在不同的土地里播种，收割，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然后写这么个文，或者做个视频啥的，都成了我的“庄稼”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我不管别人觉得好不好吃，反正我自己吃的挺开心的！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>就像封大脚他爹说的：俺要买地、买地、买地，俺要凑够<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">50</span>亩！</p>"
    }
  ]
}